# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:393
translate kr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ApproachArena_ba1118c5:

    # YARRICK @ smile "If you're hunting coin and thunder, the crowd will pay dearly to see you and your companions baptize the arena with legend."
    YARRICK @ smile "돈과 명성을 쫓는다면, 군중은 너와 네 동료들이 경기장을 전설로 세례하는 모습을 보기 위해 기꺼이 거금을 낼 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:395
translate kr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ApproachArena_c22a912e:

    # "Sypha brushed up against me."
