translate kr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ApproachArena_5be835bc:

    # YARRICK @ smile "A worthy patron, you say? Names tumble, Lord Morritan, perhaps Calistos..."
    YARRICK @ smile "가치 있는 후원자라고? 이름들이 떠오르는군, 모리탄 경, 아마도 칼리스토스..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:400
translate kr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ApproachArena_2cf4bf4d:

    # SYPHA @ happy "I was thinking more... Lord Zanzibat."
    SYPHA @ happy "좀 더... 잔지바트 경을 생각하고 있었는데."

