    SYPHA @ happy "오늘 밤... 우리 몰래 빠져나가자."
# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2025
translate kr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_8ec2dc43:

