    MC @ serious "(뭐... 개렌이 돌아올 때까지 시간이 좀 있겠지.)"
# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2040
translate kr qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_00dfcaa0:

